      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/North_Salem%2C_Indiana"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "North Salem’s main street still features historic shops and a locally famous pizzeria that draws visitors during the festival.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        28
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.townofnorthsalem.org/"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The surrounding landscape includes low flat farmland to the east and deep ravines and woodland to the west, giving the town a varied rural backdrop.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
